                        "entry_id": "7a5aac69-6379-3fcd-921a-c96507c42391",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who or that which grazes, in any sense."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "20758d1f-7651-48c9-9b83-ee2fe3ba46f6",
                                "sense_id": "169a62d0-44fe-3ec5-90bf-97e0c4f89893",
                                "text": "It seems likely that parents are free to respond in these different ways because they have no fear of their child growing into a chronic, adult knee-grazer."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "18609fa7-b0b0-3ed7-ad3c-552402151ecf",
                        "entry_id": "7a5aac69-6379-3fcd-921a-c96507c42391",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An animal that grazes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a135835-a7ab-4c88-9f2e-78b94d30518d",
                                "sense_id": "18609fa7-b0b0-3ed7-ad3c-552402151ecf",
                                "text": "There were large hippolike grazers (Teleoceras, Brachypotherium, and Peraceras superciliosum)[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7b83fb1-d491-4667-a379-7de662f41e6f",
                                "sense_id": "18609fa7-b0b0-3ed7-ad3c-552402151ecf",
                                "text": "For instance, the little bush moa fed nearly exclusively on forest vegetation, whereas the heavy-footed moa was a grazer in open vegetation habitats."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "297c68b2-bacf-33c4-bd85-2abaf8d68248",
                        "entry_id": "7a5aac69-6379-3fcd-921a-c96507c42391",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A television viewer with a short attention span who switches between channels regularly."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3fffa1dd-8fb9-48fd-9afc-dad9de153db4",
                                "sense_id": "297c68b2-bacf-33c4-bd85-2abaf8d68248",
                                "text": "Grazers have a lower level of involvement and view only when \"something is happening.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
